                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "Founded on March 28, 2013, by designer Kania Rahim, the brand focuses on crafting timeless, feminine apparel featuring intricate details like floral embroideries, unique textures, and relaxed tailoring.",
