                                  "context": "WooCommerce carousel: 2 visible cards at 390px; 12 representative products. Track scrolls horizontally and snaps at card starts. Arrow buttons move 2 cards (one visible page), clamp at bounds, previous disabled at start, next disabled at end (opacity 25%). Both controls hidden when all cards fit. Mouse drag starts after 6px; touch swipes natively; release snaps; drag suppresses accidental card click. Focusable track supports Left/Right. Smooth navigation unless reduced motion requests instant scrolling. No autoplay, looping, pagination dots or vertical wrapping. Offscreen track is intentionally clipped.",
