                                          "fill": "$ink",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "Its signature tagline, “Believe in the shadow,” expresses the philosophy that clothing acts as a reflection and shadow of one’s personal identity.",
