                            {
                              "id": "m3ZVA",
                              "type": "ref",
                              "ref": "rUMLe",
                              "name": "Load More",
                              "context": "Listing pagination: automatically fetch and append the next product page when this control is within 400px below the viewport, on desktop, tablet and mobile. Show Loading… while fetching; allow only one request at a time. Preserve filters, sort, search and URL. Announce appended products to screen readers. Remove control after the final page. Keep Load more as a manual and no-JavaScript fallback. On automatic request failure, keep existing products and pause automatic retries; manual activation retries.",
