          "id": "PtiB4",
          "name": "Motion notes",
          "fill": "$ink-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Fill rises from the bottom edge, 280ms, cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1). Label colour inverts over the same time. Press scales to 0.98 in 120ms, on touch too. Hover needs a mouse; keyboard focus shows the filled state. Disabled buttons do not animate. Links draw an underline from the left. Small icon controls fade to 60% and press to 0.92. WhatsApp float scales to 1.06, presses to 0.94. Reduced motion: colours swap instantly with no scaling.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": "$text-xs",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
