          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1800,
          "content": "Zoom button or any photo opens a full-screen carousel at that photo · Swipe, arrows or ← → keys · Counter follows active photo · No looping, arrows fade at ends · Open: clicked photo zooms from its place on the page to full screen in 420ms while the page fades to white; controls fade in after 220ms · Close (X or Esc): photo shrinks back onto its page photo in 340ms (page gallery moves to that photo first); if that photo is off-screen it drops and fades instead · Reduced motion: instant",
